      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Home-> SSG + ISR ->Content is mostly stable; revalidate periodically for banners/featured products\n\n2. Collection (PLP)-> SSG + ISR (base) / SSR (filtered)-> Base collection pre-rendered; filter/sort/pagination combos rendered on-demand\n\n3. Product page-> SSG + ISR-> Not in your list but critical - same logic as collection\n\n4. Cart-> CSR (client component, no SSR/SSG)-> User-specific, session-based, zero SEO value\n\n5. Checkout-> Redirect (not a real Next.js page)-> Shopify owns checkout for PCI compliance\n\n6. Shipping Policy-> SSG-> Static legal content, changes rarely\n\n7. Return & Refund Policy-> SSG-> Same as above\n\n8. Terms & Conditions-> SSG-> Same as above\n\n9. Privacy Policy-> SSG-> Same as above\n\n10. robots.txt-> Static (build-time)-> Generated via app/robots.ts\n\n11. llms.txt-> Static (build-time)-> Plain static file\n\n12. full-llms.txt-> SSG / build script-> Generated at build time from CMS/product data\n\n13. sitemap.xml-> Dynamic SSG + ISR-> Needs to reflect live product/collection catalog",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Home-> SSG + ISR ->Content is mostly stable; revalidate periodically for banners/featured products\n\n2. Collection (PLP)-> SSG + ISR (base) / SSR (filtered)-> Base collection pre-rendered; filter/sort/pagination combos rendered on-demand\n\n3. Product page-> SSG + ISR-> Not in your list but critical - same logic as collection\n\n4. Cart-> CSR (client component, no SSR/SSG)-> User-specific, session-based, zero SEO value\n\n5. Checkout-> Redirect (not a real Next.js page)-> Shopify owns checkout for PCI compliance\n\n6. Shipping Policy-> SSG-> Static legal content, changes rarely\n\n7. Return & Refund Policy-> SSG-> Same as above\n\n8. Terms & Conditions-> SSG-> Same as above\n\n9. Privacy Policy-> SSG-> Same as above\n\n10. robots.txt-> Static (build-time)-> Generated via app/robots.ts\n\n11. llms.txt-> Static (build-time)-> Plain static file\n\n12. full-llms.txt-> SSG / build script-> Generated at build time from CMS/product data\n\n13. sitemap.xml-> Dynamic SSG + ISR-> Needs to reflect live product/collection catalog",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
